title: The Search panel counts the same query one way with no options, another with Match Case, and another with Match Whole Word
folders: git-history
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: search 'step_1': 7 hits
expect-log: search 'Step_1': 0 hits
expect-log: search 'Step_1': 7 hits
expect-log: search 'step_1': 2 hits

wait 3000
search step_1
wait 1500
mark all-matches
wait 450
search Step_1
wait 1200
search-option case on
wait 1500
mark case-on-nothing
wait 450
search-option case off
wait 1500
mark case-off-again
wait 450
search step_1
wait 1200
search-option word on
wait 1500
mark whole-word
wait 450
search-option word off
wait 1200
quit
